{"3910800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heat 'n Hit: The Blacksmith Simulator", "steam_appid": 3910800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over your missing grandfather's workshop and embark on a journey of forging, exploration, and discovery in a vibrant, stylized medieval fantasy world. In <i>Heat 'n Hit</i>, you have complete freedom: relax by fulfilling customer requests, explore new cities in search of rare materials, or work with the guild to help heroes on their adventures. What will you do? It's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/e3147ba6452756421cae259bb983ad11.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/e3147ba6452756421cae259bb983ad11.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/e3147ba6452756421cae259bb983ad11.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start by forging your blacksmith!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in a living medieval world — where every spark from the forge tells a story of skill, ambition, and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/9800f776c6e69103cfbb870d1d0fbf42.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/9800f776c6e69103cfbb870d1d0fbf42.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/9800f776c6e69103cfbb870d1d0fbf42.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge and repair legendary weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve clients from different classes and cultures, each with unique requests, and craft swords, axes, spears, and many other weapons with full control over each forging step. You can also provide repair services for damaged weapons. Combine rare metals, finish with polishing and sharpening, and deliver masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add special effects with reagents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical reagents during the tempering process to apply unique effects to your weapons. Create flaming, freezing, or poisonous blades, or add bonuses for specific classes. Discover powerful combinations and impress everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/08391fec73901eaa7038ff2e7f86f032.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/08391fec73901eaa7038ff2e7f86f032.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/08391fec73901eaa7038ff2e7f86f032.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your stock of ores, ingots, reagents, and special materials. Buy from merchants, assist adventurers, receive from side quests, explore new cities, and progress as a blacksmith to obtain better and rarer resources. Upgrade your forge and unlock new workstations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6df5862ed512fdce6.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6df5862ed512fdce6.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6df5862ed512fdce6.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore cities and experience daily life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of the workshop to visit taverns, shops, the adventurers' guild, and gathering spots. Complete side quests or simply enjoy a moment of immersion in a world rich in detail. Each city offers new challenges, clients, and materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/0b790e1691bfdb33052b1577dbcbf9e4.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/0b790e1691bfdb33052b1577dbcbf9e4.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/0b790e1691bfdb33052b1577dbcbf9e4.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression, reputation, and day cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a full day-night cycle. Work during the day, explore at night, or sleep to advance time. Increase your reputation to unlock rare metals, new recipes, and clients from more prestigious classes. Each new reputation level opens doors to more rewarding challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/fe68fc90197bd56afc2ef57b6a913697.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/fe68fc90197bd56afc2ef57b6a913697.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/fe68fc90197bd56afc2ef57b6a913697.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story of mystery and legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather disappeared without a trace. By taking over his workshop, you'll discover hidden clues, ancient documents, and suspicious accounts. What happened to him? What secrets does your forge hold?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect cards in-game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey, you'll find rare cards as mission rewards or scattered throughout the world. Complete your collection and discover unique illustrations and intriguing descriptions of characters, weapons, and legends from the <i>Heat 'n Hit</i> universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A casual game with depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stylized art, an intuitive interface, and a pace that values both immersion and management, <i>Heat 'n Hit</i> is perfect for players seeking an accessible, engaging blacksmith simulator. Whether you want to relax or delve deep into perfect forging and magic combinations, this is your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 