197bd56afc2ef57b6a913697.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story of mystery and legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather disappeared without a trace. By taking over his workshop, you'll discover hidden clues, ancient documents, and suspicious accounts. What happened to him? What secrets does your forge hold?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect cards in-game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey, you'll find rare cards as mission rewards or scattered throughout the world. Complete your collection and discover unique illustrations and intriguing descriptions of characters, weapons, and legends from the <i>Heat 'n Hit</i> universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A casual game with depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stylized art, an intuitive interface, and a pace that values both immersion and management, <i>Heat 'n Hit</i> is perfect for players seeking an accessible, engaging blacksmith simulator. Whether you want to relax or delve deep into perfect forging and magic combinations, this is your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/202a4fd19d0e5e0f34a265cfe7da1dcf.poster.avif?t=1764993312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/202a4fd19d0e5e0f34a265cfe7da1dcf.webm?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/extras/202a4fd19d0e5e0f34a265cfe7da1dcf.mp4?t=1764993312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you forge legendary weapons and uncover the mystery behind your grandfather's disappearance?</strong></p>", "short_description": "You are a blacksmith in a medieval fantasy world. Take over your missing grandfather's workshop, forge legendary weapons, and rise from apprentice to legend. Explore distant cities, gather rare materials, and uncover the mystery behind your grandfather's disappearance.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Hungarian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Czech, Turkish, Dutch, Indonesian, Romanian, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Arabic, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910800/556cbce5c80